  "body": "Our vendors instructions are to present all offers.\r\n\r\n1 Kapai Road is the perfect example of why Auckland's favourite seaside village of Devonport is the perfect place to call home. This substantial and immaculate residence is positioned just off the Queens Parade waterfront. An impressive street presence and a private outlook give way to an attractive Edwardian veranda and wide kauri hallway. Four double bedrooms, and two-family bathrooms, give flexible living options at ground and upper floor level. A formal lounge, open plan kitchen and dining room flow out onto the expansive upper deck with separate studio and well-designed mature north facing gardens beyond. There is also a study which is an ideal 'work from home room'. A large media room at ground floor level gives you that all important second living area and the spacious laundry can also be used as a kitchenette. Off street parking for three cars is also available. Both traditional and modern style have been thoughtfully incorporated into the home. The standard of presentation and care demonstrates meticulous attention to detail with high quality fittings throughout.\r\n\r\nDevonport Village, with all the wonderful local amenities on offer, is a 'hop, skip and a jump' away and you have a five-minute stroll to the regular City ferry service. Kapai Road is a quiet cul-de-sac with attractive and authentic homes all around, and this fabulous villa is undoubtedly one of the best that Devonport has to offer.\r\n\r\nView by appointment.\r\n\r\n(CV $3,075,000)",
